{%- comment -%}
  "Skin-Loving Ingredients" section (exact copy of the evorabody.com section, rebuilt from its own stylesheet): an italic title, a short line, a row of cream ingredient cards that you swipe or drag sideways (the scroll bar is hidden), and a "View all ingredients" button that slides open the full ingredient list.
  Cards are 275px wide on desktop and tablet and 75% of the screen width on phones. The cards snap into place as you swipe. Mouse users can also click and drag the row (set mb_drag to false to turn that off).
  No slider app or library, so it loads fast.
  WHERE: best as its own full-width section: Online Store > Themes > Customize > Product page > Add section > Custom Liquid, drag it where you want it, paste this in.
  If you paste it inside a narrow column instead, set mb_bleed to false.
  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW. Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; instead.
  mb_title = the italic title. mb_subtitle = the line under it (leave empty to hide it).
  mb_cards = your ingredient cards, separated by @@ and each one written as   PICTURE LINK ||| NAME ||| DESCRIPTION
  (use [br] inside a description for a line break. With no picture link, a grey square shows so you can see the layout. Add as many cards as you like.)
  mb_btn = the button text. mb_list = the full ingredient list that opens under the button (leave empty to hide the button).
  THE 6 PICTURES BELOW ARE LINKED FROM evorabody.com SO YOU CAN SEE THE SECTION WORKING. For a live store, save each picture, upload it in Shopify admin > Content > Files, then paste your own links in place. That keeps the section working if the original files ever change.
  IMPORTANT: the six ingredients, their descriptions and the full list below must match what is really in your product and printed on your label.
  mb_bg = section colour. mb_card_bg = card colour. mb_color_text = every text colour. mb_card_w = card width on desktop and tablet. mb_gap = space between cards.
  mb_pad_d / mb_pad_m = space inside the section on desktop / phone, written as top left-right bottom, for example 50px 0 50px.
  mb_bleed = true stretches the section edge to edge across the screen. mb_top / mb_bottom = space above and below the block.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture mb_cards -%}
